<header class="container">
    <div class="page-heading">
<h1>King County Code</h1><div class="summary-text">Explore the laws and charter governing King County.</div>    </div>
</header>


<div class="rich-text"><p>All permanent or general laws are incorporated into and become a part of the King County Code. The contents of the code establish prima facie the laws of the county that are of a permanent or general nature.<br />
<br />
We make the code available for your research use and convenience.&nbsp;If there is an omission or an inconsistency between the code and an ordinance, the ordinance prevails. Failure to codify an ordinance doesn't affect the applicability of the ordinance as law. (K.C.C. 1.02.070). Please notify the Clerk's office if you identify electronic conversion or transmission errors.</p>
<p>Selecting a document title, which acts as a link, opens the document in a web page. You can also view them in PDF and Word formats.</p></div>
            </div>
            <aside class="col-md-12 col-lg-4 right-rail">
                

<aside class="vital-info-one-col" aria-labelledby="vitalInfoHeading-feecaaa615ad490182dd7dcc713fc779">
    <div class="vital-wrapper" id="vitalInfoHeading-feecaaa615ad490182dd7dcc713fc779">
        <h2 class='vital-info-heading'>for more information, contact</h2>
        
        <div class="rich-text"><p>Melani Hay, Clerk of the Council</p>
<p>Address:&nbsp;<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir//516+3rd+Ave,+Seattle,+WA+98104/@47.607401,-122.3425895,15z/data=!4m8!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x54906aba6e559577:0x4fbda7a312401f46!2m2!1d-122.330656!2d47.6026851?entry=ttu" target="_blank">516 Third Ave, Room 1200<br />
Seattle, Washington 98104</a></p>
<p>Email:&nbsp;<a href="mailto:clerk@kingcounty.gov">clerk.council@kingcounty.gov</a></p>
<p>Phone:&nbsp;<a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="tel:2064771000" target="_blank">206-477-1020</a>&nbsp;</p>
<p>TTY/TDD: Relay 711</p></div>
    </div>
</aside>
