<div class="rich-text"><h3><a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/23_Title_20.htm" target="_blank">Title 20: Planning</a></h3>
<p>Also view Title 20: Planning as a <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/23_Title_20.pdf" target="_blank">PDF</a> or <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/23_Title_20.docx" target="_blank">Word</a> document.</p>
