<p>View <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://kingcounty.gov/depts/local-services/permits/planning-regulations.aspx" target="_blank">planning and regulations from the Local Services Permitting Division</a></p>
<h3><a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/24-30_Title_21A.htm" target="_blank">Title 21A: Zoning</a></h3>
<p>Also view Title 21A: Zoning as a <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/24-30_Title_21A.pdf" target="_blank">PDF</a> or <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/24-30_Title_21A.docx" target="_blank">Word</a> document.</p>
<p>(Updated: 9/9/2026) </p>
<p>View <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://kingcounty.gov/depts/local-services/permits/planning-regulations.aspx" target="_blank">planning and regulations from the Local Services Permitting Division</a></p>
<h3><a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/31_Title_22.htm" target="_blank">Title 22: Stadium</a></h3>
<p>Also view Title 22: Stadium as a <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/31_Title_22.pdf" target="_blank">PDF</a> or <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/31_Title_22.docx" target="_blank">Word</a> document.</p>
<p>(Updated: 10/20/2022)</p>
<h3><a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/32_Title_23.htm" target="_blank">Title 23: Code Compliance</a></h3>
<p>Also view Title 23: Code Compliance as a <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/32_Title_23.pdf" target="_blank">PDF</a> or <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/32_Title_23.docx" target="_blank">Word</a> document.</p>
<p>(Updated: 8/14/2025)</p>
<h3><a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/33_Title_24.htm" target="_blank">Title 24: Housing and Community Development</a></h3>
<p>Also view Title 24: Housing and Community Development as a <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/33_Title_24.pdf" target="_blank">PDF</a> or <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/33_Title_24.docx" target="_blank">Word</a> document.</p>
<p>(Updated: 9/9/2026) </p>
<h3><a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/35_Title_26.htm" target="_blank">Title 26: Agricultural and Open Space Lands</a></h3>
<p>Also view Title 26: Agricultural and Open Space Lands as a <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/35_Title_26.pdf" target="_blank">PDF</a> or <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://aqua.kingcounty.gov/council/clerk/code/35_Title_26.docx" target="_blank">Word</a> document.</p>
